WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:14.400
We take a lot of our daily habits for granted,

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.840
don’t we?

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:21.840
We often forget that almost 
everything we use is regulated by laws.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:28.560
But when politicians create laws
that affect 450 million citizens,

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:31.280
what source of information
can they rely on?

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.480
Who can they trust?

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:39.800
Since 1957
we have been providing policymakers

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:42.200
with the facts that help them decide.

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:46.880
We look into everything
that impacts society and our well-being,

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:50.640
and we anticipate
the trends that will shape Europe.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:57.120
Our labs count a diverse mix of scientists
who excel in their fields

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:01.400
and collaborate with the best
research institutes in the world.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:14.480
Through the short-term lens
of news and social commentary,

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:16.720
the world might look troubled...

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:23.720
But the future becomes clearer
when we take the long-term view

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:26.680
of science and knowledge.

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:33.880
Opinion and influence
cannot shape a political agenda...

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:41.520
But healthy scientific discussion,
transparency and continuous study

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:44.680
can lead to better policies for all.

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:49.520
We are the Joint Research Centre
of the European Commission.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.880
We provide independent,
evidence-based knowledge and science,

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:58.200
supporting EU policies
to positively impact society.

